<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-TURKEY AND FINLAND DRAW 1-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TURKEY AND FINLAND DRAW 1-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey and Finland drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a friendly soccer international in Denizli on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Turkey - Tolunay Kafkas 28</p>
<p>Finland - Jari Litmanen 18</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
